     name and rewrite the description and the steps below. Only name and description are in the
     system prompt; the model reads the rest when it calls load_skill. Remove this comment. -->

## Steps

1. Call `get_disk_usage` for the folder the user asks about (`/data` when they do not say).
2. If less than 10 % is free, say so first and suggest deleting old event clips in the Event Log.
3. Give the free space in GB, rounded to one decimal.

## Common mistakes

- Do not guess a number: call the tool every time, the free space changes.
- If the tool says the folder does not exist, ask the user for the right path.
